  "result": "{\"seen_before\": false, \"matches\": [], \"answer\": \"I found no earlier ticket that reports this problem. Searches on the Populate() and index.yml ordering, and on the manifest index needing two restarts, returned nothing relevant. The Shortcut Guide tickets I did find cover different problems, such as crashes, missing manifests, and new manifest requests. Treat this as a new bug. Your diagnosis is a good starting point for the report: PowerToysShortcutsPopulator.Populate() runs after the index.yml generation, so the index is built from the old data. Moving Populate() before the index generation should make a changed shortcut show up after one restart, or immediately. Until it's fixed, restarting PowerToys twice shows the updated shortcut.\"}",
